# Theme lock (muted earth)

Color and lighting are **locked**. Do not retune hex, jobs, or add hues unless the user explicitly asks to reopen the palette.

## Tokens (jobs, not a swatch pack)

| Token | Hex | Job |
| --- | --- | --- |
| canvas | `#151A12` | olive charcoal background |
| card | `#4A3F34` | taupe-olive / mahogany-brown surfaces |
| text | `#EDE4D4` | warm cream body and headings |
| muted | `#C4B5A5` | taupe for roles/captions only |
| accent | `#D17650` | terracotta/rust — hero word, metrics, primary CTA only |
| sage | `#B5C1A8` | tags, section rules, labels |
| mahogany | `#4A3032` | nav active, borders, hover depth — not a second hero hue |

Source of truth: `app/globals.css` (`--background`, `--card`, `--foreground`, `--accent-rose`, `--accent-sage`, `--accent-mahogany`).

## Do not

- Change these hex values or invent mustard, sky blue, violet, mauve, extra pinks
- Paint large backgrounds or body copy in rust/peach
- Use rust on card/project descriptions (body = cream)
- Clone a sitcom interior or name films/shows on the site
- Claim designer identity; stay engineer-first
- Rewrite locked case-study copy

## Lighting (also locked)

Upper-left warm light. `.surface-panel` / `.surface-chrome`: cream highlight on the lit edge, mahogany/olive on the unlit side. Canvas vignette + ~3% grain. Primary CTA (`.cta-lit`) gets an **inner** top highlight, not an outer halo. Sage in shadows only as bounce.

